      "quote": "The safety and effectiveness have been established only for the following pediatric indications: • MYRBETRIQ: Treatment of neurogenic detrusor overactivity (NDO) in pediatric patients 3 years of age and older and weighing 35 kg or more. • MYRBETRIQ Granules: Treatment of neurogenic detrusor overactivity (NDO) in …",
